<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY'S MEZOGEP TO START TRADE ON MAY 5 - BOURSE.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY'S MEZOGEP TO START TRADE ON MAY 5 - BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said on Wednesday it set May 5 as the first trading day in shares of Hungarian machinery company Mezogep Rt.</p>
<p>The company requested the listing of 7,926,000 shares, each with a 100 forint face value.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
